    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like there’s nothing left of me. everything i spent my entire life building, all those years of research and the phd... it's just gone. i'm not a scholar anymore, i'm just some person sitting in a room with a bunch of useless degrees. i don't even know who i am without the work. it's like the person i was actually died when the career ended.",
